                                Kaushik Vora
                            </p>
                            <p class="text-sm lg:text-base text-gray-600 max-w-3xl text-justify md:text-center px-auto leading-none mb-2">
                                Investments
                            </p>
                            <p @click="showModal = 'vora'" class="text-xs lg:text-sm text-[var(--primary-color)] font-medium cursor-pointer" >Read More...</p>
                            
