                                                Kaushik has 20+ years in invest management, real estate, private equity, and wealth products. He has led structuring, due dilligence, and portfolio managemnt for HMNIs, family offices, and institutions, scalling AUM from hundreds to thousands of crores. He holds an MBA in finance and an Eecutive program in Fintech from IIM Kozhikode.
                                            </p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
